OL,3,GNEWSACity's driving test centre could
OL,4,Amove under plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA city's driving test centre will move
OL,7,Fif a plan to increase capacity is given
OL,8,Fthe go-ahead.
OL,10,FThe Driving Vehicle Standards Agency
OL,11,F(DVSA) wants to move its Oxford centre
OL,12,Fto a vacant office building at the Isis
OL,13,FBusiness Centre in Cowley.
OL,15,FIt said the move from its current
OL,16,Flocation in James Wolfe Road, about one
OL,17,Fmile (1.6km) away from the proposed new
OL,18,Fsite, would help meet local demand and
OL,19,Fdrive down waiting times for tests.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
