OL,3,GNEWSACity's driving test centre could
OL,4,Amove under plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new centre would be less affected
OL,7,Fby Oxfordshire County Council's traffic
OL,8,Ffilters than its current location, the
OL,9,Fagency added.
